# Visual-capture artifacts are EPHEMERAL — never tracked. The harness writes
# capture PNGs + composites + manifests/logs into a caller-chosen output dir
# (demo/, village/, sxs/, MANIFEST*, *.log); defaults land in /tmp, but if a run
# points its BASE inside this folder these patterns keep them out of git.
#
# Allowlist: the tracked harness scripts + docs, PLUS the committed `baseline/`
# (the same-component transcript-browser <SessionDetail> reference — the ONE
# capture set that IS tracked, as the no-regression "before"). Add a new `!path`
# line to track any future script.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!probe-village.mjs
!probe-explore.mjs
!village-shoot.mjs
!manage-shoot.mjs
!explore-shoot.mjs
!surface-gate.mjs
!stitch-sxs.mjs
!manage-stitch-sxs.mjs
!boot-village.mjs
!manage-boot-village.mjs
!boot-explore.mjs
!mock-rest.mjs
!mock-rest-explore.mjs
!mock-rest-pagination.mjs
!explore-pagination-shoot.mjs
!explore-agent-group-shoot.mjs
!mock-rest-project.mjs
!project-page-shoot.mjs
!png-diff.mjs
!determinism.mjs
!manage-README.md
!baseline/
!baseline/**
